VASCO GOMES: Good
afternoon, everyone.

00:00:08.390 --> 00:00:09.510
My name is Vasco Gomes.

00:00:09.510 --> 00:00:14.440
I am the Global CTO for
Cybersecurity Products at Atos.

00:00:14.440 --> 00:00:17.380
Atos is a global
digital services leader,

00:00:17.380 --> 00:00:23.710
generating 12 billion euros,
or approximately $13.5 billion,

00:00:23.710 --> 00:00:25.960
