intelligence, machine learning,

00:00:41.050 --> 00:00:45.970
hybrid cloud, and
digital workplace.

00:00:45.970 --> 00:00:50.620
In these initiatives, we embed
our own cybersecurity product

00:00:50.620 --> 00:00:54.400
solutions and cybersecurity
products from third parties

00:00:54.400 --> 00:00:57.520
that we leverage to secure
these services to customers.

00:00:57.520 --> 00:01:02.030
We have opened three AI labs
around the world-- in Paris,

00:01:02.030 --> 00:01:04.900
London, and Dallas in the US--

00:01:04.900 --> 00:01:11.380
where we welcome customers to
